{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DquBpeahNk1TUZ2VAcUfqU","type":"tool_result","content":"[\n  'skill',\n  'version',\n  'routerPolicy',\n  'routerSignals',\n  'vocabularyClasses'\n]\n{\"skill\":\"mcp-browser-use\",\"version\":\"1.1.1.0\",\"routerPolicy\":{\"defaultMode\":null,\"ambiguityDelta\":1,\"tieBreak\":[\"mcp-chrome-devtools\",\"mcp-aside-devtools\",\"mcp-bladebro\"],\"outcomes\":{\"single\":\"one dominant browser signal routes to one mode\",\"orderedBundle\":\"multiple explicitly named browser tools route in tie-break order\",\"defer\":\"unclear or generic browser phrasing asks for disambiguation\"},\"defaultResource\":[\"ROUTER.md\",\"mode-registry.json\"],\"defaultResourceSemantics\":\"fallback-only\",\"defaultResourceContract\":\"A scored route assembles exactly the selected mode's declared resources. defaultResource is consulted only when no mode scores, and then only as the defer-time suggestion offered alongside disambiguation. It is never added to a scored route's resource set.\",\"discoveryClasses\":[\"hub-identity\",\"generic-browser-automation\"],\"discoveryClassesContract\":\"Classes listed here are hub discovery and defer evidence only. No mode's scoring classes reference them, so a prompt that matches only discovery vocabulary scores zero modes and takes the defer outcome instead of fanning out to every mode.\"},\"routerSignals\":{\"mcp-chrome-devtools\":{\"weight\":4,\"classes\":[\"chrome-devtools-aliases\",\"browser-debug\"],\"resources\":[\"mcp-chrome-devtools/SKILL.md\"]},\"mcp-aside-devtools\":{\"weight\":4,\"classes\":[\"aside-devtools-aliases\",\"aside-repl-evidence\"],\"resources\":[\"mcp-aside-devtools/SKILL.md\"]},\"mcp-bladebro\":{\"weight\":4,\"classes\":[\"bladebro-aliases\",\"bladebro-workflow\"],\"resources\":[\"mcp-bladebro/SKILL.md\"]}},\"vocabularyClasses\":{\"hub-identity\":{\"note\":\"Discovery-only. Hub-level vocabulary that identifies this hub, not any one mode. Deliberately unrefer