proval as the blocker.\n2. If the operator still needs a named session, stop after step 3, keep the data root, and record `SKIP` for the root removal with that reason.\n3. If step 6 prints `root remains`, compare the path against the one step 1 printed before running anything else.\n\n---\n\n## 4. SOURCE FILES\n\n### Playbook Sources","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[],"moreFiles":0,"unavailable":true}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016bKA6VSZpjopLvFbyXUyDq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
