ts itself.\n   Finding class: doc drift after a live result.\n   Scope proof: rg of `page.on(` and `page.context()` across the Aside packet.\n   Affected surface hints: mcp-aside-devtools SKILL.md rules section, README FAQ, feature-catalog.md index rows, the two devtools-parity leaves.\n   Case: an agent following SKILL.md:147 or README.md:189 calls `page.on('console', ...)` in `aside repl` on 1.26.626.1517 and gets the unsupported-event error instead of `page.console.logs()`.\n\n## Traceability Checks\n- feature_catalog_code (partial): Chrome DevTools catalog has 31 leaves and SKILL.md:226 says 31 features (005 criterion holds); Aside catalog index rows contradict the live result (finding 1).\n- playbook_capability (pass): Chrome DevTools 30 playbook leaves (007), Bladebro 15 scenarios as manual-testing-playbook.md:20 says (008), Aside 29 scenarios as manual-testing-playbook.md:35 says.\n- skill_agent (pass): hub SKILL.md, mode-registry.json, hub-router.json and description.json all read 1.1.1.0 and the parent changelog head is v1.1.1.0; mode SKILL.md versions (1.0.27.0, 1.1.12.0, 1.2.0.0) equal their changelog heads.\n\n## Integration Evidence\n- `.skilled/changelog/mcp-browser-use/{parent,mcp-chrome-devtools,mcp-aside-devtools,mcp-bladebro}` are symlinks into the skill changelog folders (007 topology), so there is one source per changelog.\n- rg for `bdg cdp <Method> '{` (positional JSON) over the hub printed no match, so 013's fix holds; all 10 chrome-devtools-mcp pins read 0.26.0.\n\n## Edge Cases\n- ROUTER.md `CHROME_DEVTOOLS` lacks \"chrome live manual\" and \"core web vitals\" from hub-router.json; \"lighthouse\" and \"performance trace\" sit in ROUTER.md's `LIGHTHOUSE_TRACE` intent instead. The first two are the prior generation's R1-P1-001, downgraded to P2 and left unchanged by operator decision, so they are not re-raised.\n- Top-level `await` in Aside catalog snippets runs inside `aside repl`, which accepts it; 013's \"drop top-level await\" applies to Code Mode blocks only.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n- Version stamps and changelog heads agree across hub and modes.\n- Catalog and playbook counts match the numbers in their docs.\n\n## Ruled Out\n- Changelog duplication between skill folders and `.skilled/changelog/`: symlinks, single source.\n\n## Next Focus\n- Dimension: correctness (second pass, all four dimensions covered)\n- Focus area: shipped scripts and Code Mode examples against the bdg 0.6.10 and Bladebro 4.8.2 contracts (doctor.sh lane checks, chrome-devtools install.sh macOS Chrome detection from 013, Bladebro attach scenario from 008).\n- Reason: dimension coverage complete; residual risk sits in executable scripts the doc passes only sampled.\n- Required evidence: script file:line.\n\nReview verdict: PASS\nEOF\ncat > /tmp/opus2dr/s4.json <<'EOF'\n{\"iteration\":4,\"focus\":\"maintainability: hub and mode doc consistency\",\"dimensions\":[\"maintainability\"],\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-24T05:01:00Z\",\n\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/ROUTER.md:51\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/hub-router.json\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/SKILL.md:147\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/README.md:189\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:139\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/feature-catalog/devtools-parity/console-and-network-capture.md:32\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/feature-catalog/devtools-parity/cookies-and-storage.md:29\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/SKILL.md:226\",\".skilled/changelog/mcp-browser-use\"],\n\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"O2-I4-P2-001\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"title\":\"Aside docs still teach page.on capture and page.context() cookies after the live run proved both throw on 1.26.626.1517\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/SKILL.md:147\",\"findingClass\":\"doc-drift-after-live-result\",\"scopeProof\":\"rg page.on( and page.context() across the Aside packet\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"mcp-aside-devtools/SKILL.md\",\"mcp-aside-devtools/README.md\",\"mcp-aside-devtools/feature-catalog\"]}],\n\"traceability\":[{\"protocolId\":\"feature_catalog_code\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"gateClass\":\"advisory\",\"applicable\":true,\"evidence\":[\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/SKILL.md:226\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:139\"],\"summary\":\"counts match; Aside index rows contradict live result\"},{\"protocolId\":\"playbook_capability\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"gateClass\":\"advisory\",\"applicable\":true,\"evidence\":[\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-bladebro/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:20\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:35\"],\"summary\":\"scenario counts match leaves for all three modes\"},{\"protocolId\":\"skill_agent\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"gateClass\":\"advisory\",\"applicable\":true,\"evidence\":[\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/SKILL.md\",\".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mode-registry.json\"],\"summary\":\"version stamps and changelog heads agree\"}],\n\"ruledOut\":[{\"direction\":\"changelog duplication between skill folders and .skilled/changelog\",\"reason\":\"symlinks, single source\"}],\n\"ratio\":0.14,\"justification\":\"one new P2 (weight 1) against seven accumulated weighted findings\"}\nEOF\nnode /tmp/opus2dr/rec.js /tmp/opus2dr/s4.json 2>&1 | cut -c1-120","description":"Write iteration 4 artifacts and reduce"}}}
