ft-after-live-result. | Rewrite them to `page.console.logs()` and `page.evaluate` | open |","+| O2-I5-P2-001 | P2 | correctness | `mcp-chrome-devtools/scripts/install.sh:28` | `browser-debugger-cli@alpha` floats, while 10 files document bdg 0.6.10 behaviour. Class unpinned-dependency. | Pin 0.6.10, or record the alpha policy and re-verify | open |","+| O2-I6-P2-001 | P2 | security | `mcp-bladebro/.../attach-mode-reads.md:45` | BB-015 opens `<browser app>` with a debug port on its live profile. Branded Chrome 136+ refuses that, and triage item 1 blames a still-running browser. Both recorded passes used Aside. Class scenario-precondition-gap. | Add the browser precondition and a triage row | open |","+","+## 4. Remediation Workstreams","+","+No P0 or P1 workstream. P2 advisories:","+1. WS1 goal and parent hygiene: O2-I3-P2-001, O2-I3-P2-002.","+2. WS2 doc drift: O2-I4-P2-001, O2-I6-P2-001, O2-I1-P2-001.","+3. WS3 install supply chain: O2-I2-P2-001, O2-I5-P2-001.","+4. WS4 evidence and orphaned requirements: O2-I3-P2-003, O2-I3-P2-004.","+5. Gate repair: re-anchor O2-I3-P2-003 to the in-scope 008 implementation-summary.md:144 at merge time.","+","+## 5. Spec Seed","+","+- 003 and 004 goal.md: tick the criteria and set the continuity to complete.","+- Parent spec.md: fill the 006→007 handoff criterion and update the Branch row.","+- Pick a phase to own 005 REQ-003, REQ-008 and REQ-009, or close them by decision.","+","+## 6. Plan Seed","+","+- Aside packet: replace the `page.on`/`page.context()` guidance in SKILL.md:147, README.md:189, feature-catalog.md:139-142 and the two devtools-parity code blocks.","+- Chrome DevTools: pin `browser-debugger-cli@0.6.10` in install.sh:28, SKILL.md:61 and INSTALL-GUIDE.md, or document why alpha floats.","+- Bladebro install.sh: test `--ignore-scripts` against 4.8.2. If the launcher still resolves the native package, adopt it.","+- BB-015: add \"Aside or another non-branded Chromium. Branded Chrome 136+ needs a non-default --user-data-