des: 0.","+- Swept: correctness (iterations 1, 5), security (2, 6), traceability (3, 7), maintainability (4).","+- Remaining frontier: Code Mode example blocks in the Chrome DevTools packet and hub README navigation were sampled only.","+","+## 9. Search Ledger","+","+*No search-depth state captured (legacy v1 record)*. The iteration records are unversioned (no `reviewDepthSchemaVersion: 2`). hasSearchDebt: false (search_debt 0).","+","+## 10. Audit Appendix","+","+- Convergence: weightedStopScore went 0.25 (iterations 4-6) then 0.55 (iteration 7). Rolling average 0.1325 → 0.1175, above its stop line. Decision at iteration 7: STOP `maxIterationsReached`, blockedBy `dimensionCoverageGate` (traceability partial).","+- newFindingsRatio per iteration: 1.0, 0.5, 0.67, 0.14, 0.125, 0.11, 0.0.","+- Coverage: all four canonical dimensions covered (registry dimensionCoverage all true).","+- Ruled out: the prompt-text `forbidden` reject in the browser hub (fixed, with a canary), the unconditional Bladebro data-root `rm -rf` (fixed), secrets in the UTCP browser manuals (none), changelog duplication (symlinks), Bladebro doctor/installer pin drift (identical constants), real-browser scenarios without operator selection (gated), and re-raising prior-generation P2s.","+- Sources reviewed: see each `iterations/iteration-00N.md` Files Reviewed section. Live commands: `compiled-route.cjs --hub mcp-browser-use` (14/14 canaries match), `skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend` (one prompt per mode plus the REQ-009 phrases), `parent-skill-check.cjs` on both hubs (OK, 0 warnings).","+- Gate 3 / write scope: every write stayed inside `review/lineages/opus-2`. All state rows went through `append-mode-event.cjs` (ledger sequences 1-10)."]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/review/lineages/opus-2/deep-review-dashboard.md","/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/specs/mcp/